@startuml 18_state_mobile
title Flutter dashboard auth, fleet, and pairing states
[*] --> SIGNED_OUT
SIGNED_OUT --> VALIDATING : Supabase sign-in
VALIDATING --> DENIED : JWT rejected / not approved
VALIDATING --> READY : approved JWT and workspace membership
DENIED --> SIGNED_OUT : sign out
READY --> REFRESHING : periodic 5s fleet refresh
REFRESHING --> READY : authorized updated data
REFRESHING --> ERROR : timeout / denied
ERROR --> READY : successful retry
READY --> PAIRING_LOOKUP : Add device / enter code
PAIRING_LOOKUP --> PAIRING_REVIEW : valid pending code and authorized role
PAIRING_LOOKUP --> READY : unknown / expired / rate-limited
PAIRING_REVIEW --> PAIRING_APPROVING : explicit approval
PAIRING_REVIEW --> READY : deny / cancel
PAIRING_APPROVING --> READY : server confirmation
PAIRING_APPROVING --> ERROR : failure
READY --> DEVICE_MANAGEMENT : open devices
DEVICE_MANAGEMENT --> READY : close
READY --> SIGNED_OUT : sign out
@enduml
